  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>This is a simple Addon device that can be attached to any normal <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Communications_Devices\" title=\"Communications Devices\">Communications Device</a>, such as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Comlink\" title=\"Comlink\">Comlink</a> and more advanced transceiver. The Pocket Scrambler automatically encodes any outgoing message so that it can be read only by a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Communications_Devices\" title=\"Communications Devices\">Communications Device</a> equipped with a linked Pocket Scrambler. Anyone who intercepts the scrambled message must make a DC 30 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Use_Computer\" title=\"Use Computer\">Use Computer</a> check to decrypt it. </p>",
